  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO/GUILLERMO CANO WORLD PRESS FREEDOM PRIZE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNESCO/Guillermo Cano World Press Freedom Prize is awarded to honour a person, organization or institution that has made an outstanding contribution to the defence and/or promotion of press freedom anywhere in the world, especially when this has been achieved in the face of danger on every 3 May, which is a date that celebrates the fundamental principles of press freedom; both online and offline.</narrative>
  </description>
